{
 "id": 1158483,
 "titulo": "4.1 Update Details",
 "fecha": 1527577748199,
 "modificada": 1732811674977,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1158483",
 "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">It is time to unveil the latest additions to Marvel Future Fight in our big v4.1 update, the 2<sup>nd</sup>&nbsp;update inspired by Marvel&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Avengers:</em>&nbsp;<em>Infinity Wa</em>r!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">This update is the sequel to last month&rsquo;s update, one that includes new uniforms inspired by Marvel&rsquo;s&nbsp;<em>Avengers:</em>&nbsp;<em>Infinity Wa</em>r including characters such as Scarlet Witch, Doctor Strange, Hulkbuster 2.0, and War Machine!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">A new ascension to Tier-3 awaits for Iron Man and Spider-Man as they await to break through their limitations and become Tier-3. This includes new growth factors to further Amplify their abilities.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Of course, in order to reach Tier-3, you will need essential items to reach there, and that is where the new additions for World Boss: Ultimate stages comes in handy. You will now be able to face Corvus Glaive and Cull Obsidian in an Ultimate setting.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">A new feature for Alliance Battle awaits, where you can now access your Personal Rankings to see where you stand against other Agents!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Other updates such as Inventory improvements and continuous Uru Amplification have been included to provide Agents with a more convenient way to advance their troops.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Hurry now and see details below!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><br /></span><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;8 New Uniforms</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">New uniforms for Scarlet Witch, Doctor Strange, Hulkbuster 2.0, War Machine, Star-Lord, Rocket Raccoon, Ebony Maw, and Cull Obsidian have been added.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/291026/01.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #c00000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%;\">* The 8 new uniforms will be on a&nbsp;special&nbsp;<strong>DISCOUNT&nbsp;</strong>for a limited period. Check out the new uniforms at the Marvel Universe/Uniform Room in the Shop.</span><br />* New Uniforms&nbsp;will be&nbsp;available on a&nbsp;<strong>40% ~ 80%</strong>&nbsp;<strong>DISCOUNT</strong>&nbsp;for a limited time:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/291026/02.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;New Tier-3 Characters Added!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">The previous update introduced you to a whole new level of power that is&nbsp;<strong>Tier-3</strong>&nbsp;with Captain America.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">This upcoming update will now include&nbsp;<strong>Iron Man</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Spider-Man</strong>&nbsp;to keep Captain America company!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Iron Man</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"https://thumbs.gfycat.com/WellgroomedNeglectedAmericancrow-max-14mb.gif\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Spider-Man</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"https://thumbs.gfycat.com/RapidDirtyBasilisk-max-14mb.gif\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;New Bosses for World Boss Ultimate + Additional Changes</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">2 New Stages for World Boss Update</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">The previous update introduced you to Proxima Midnight being available on World Boss: Ultimate. And now, we have added 2 more bosses for this ultimate challenge:&nbsp;<strong>Corvus Glaive</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>Cull Obsidian</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Corvus Glaive Ultimate</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/05/251745/image3.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- Clearing the Ultimate mode against Corvus Glaive will give you critical growth ingredients for Tier-3 as well as Titan&rsquo;s Record: Speed!</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Cull Obsidian Ultimate</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><img style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/05/251745/image4.png\" /></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- Clearing the Ultimate mode against Cull Obsidian will give you critical growth ingredients for Tier-3 as well as Titan&rsquo;s Record: Blast!</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Changes in My Hero Portrait for World Boss Rankings</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">If your personal record is ranked in the World Boss Rankings after equipping a uniform, the uniform will be displayed on your ranking.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Changes in Display of Accumulated EXP on Raid Levels</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Display of Accumulated EXP on Raid Levels has been changed to only display accumulated EXP for your current Raid Level. (Previously, it displayed all EXP acquired since Raid Level 1.)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> New Potential Unlocked</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Realizing Potential and enhancing its level will be available for 7 characters: Star-Lord, Rocket Raccoon, Black Dwarf, Ebony Maw, Hulkbuster (Iron Man Mark 44), War Machine, and Scarlet Witch.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;A Massive Overhaul and Changes in S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">1. Warp Device Undergoes Renewal</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">The system and UI for the Warp Device and its Mission Deployment went through a complete overhaul to provide not only visual changes&nbsp;but also new deployment missions and improved rewards.</span></p>\r\n<p><img style=\"font-size: 10pt;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/05/251745/image5.png\" /></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">-</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;The restriction on the&nbsp;number of Deployment Missions has been removed.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><br /><strong style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- Each mission will be color-coded based on the&nbsp;level of difficulty.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><br /><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- Higher levels of difficulty will grant bigger rewards.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">※</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;These mission levels will be divided into Common/Advanced/Rare/Heroic/Legendary/Mythic levels, and each level will be coded in different colors.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 8.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">Common &ndash; White</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 8.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">Advanced &ndash; Green</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 8.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">Rare &ndash; Blue</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 8.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">Heroic &ndash; Purple</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 8.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">Legendary &ndash; Orange</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 8.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">Mythical &ndash; Red</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/05/251745/image6.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">-</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;Each mission&rsquo;s success rate will increase based on the level of characters deployed.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;- Deploying recommended characters will merit more rewards.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;- The cost for deploying characters has been changed from Anti-Matter to Gold. The cost increases as you deploy more characters.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;- Successful missions will grant character EXP and Dimension Tokens.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">※</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;Instant Clear/Complete Now function after deployment has been removed.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">※</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">Previous Warp Device will be reset after the update and all unclaimed rewards will no longer be available.</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">※</span></strong><strong style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;Biometrics will no longer be obtainable through missions in the Warp Device.&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">What are Dimension Tokens?</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/05/251745/image7.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Dimension Tokens are new items you can use to purchase products in the Item Shop or use the Update List function.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></strong><img style=\"font-size: 11px;\" src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/05/251745/image8.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">-</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">Increasing the rank of your Warp Device increases the chance of obtaining special missions or the number of deployable missions.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">※</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;Special missions start at all levels except Common level (available on Advanced, Rare, Heroic, Legendary, Mythical levels).</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">2. S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab Item Shop Improvements</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Products available in the Item Shop have been improved. A new Special Product section has also been added.</span></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/05/251745/image9.png\" /><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- Products inside the Item Shop are reorganized by 6 items.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><br /><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- With the addition of new products, quantity and prices of some products have been adjusted.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/05/251745/image10.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">-</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;Purchasing general products from the Item Shop will fill up the special product gauge. Once the gauge is filled to 100%, a Special Product will be unlocked for purchase.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">※</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;Special products will remain until the next reset. All other products will also be reset at this time.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/281048/image11.png\" />&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">-Tapping on the magnifying glass will allow you to inspect the possible general and special products available in the Item Shop.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/281048/image12.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\"><strong>-Dimension Tokens obtained from the Warp Device can be used to &#114;efresh the list of available products in the Item Shop via the Update List &#98;utton.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">※</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;Using the Update List function will reset all available general and special products, including the special product gauge.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/281048/image13.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">-</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 굴림; color: #0075c8;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;Increasing the rank of the Item Shop can reduce the cost of &#114;efreshing the listed products or change products offered for purchase.</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">3. Changes on Anti-Matter Generator</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">The display of acquired Anti-Matter in the Generator has been improved.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/281048/image14.png\" />&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">-The Anti-Matter Generator now shows the exact number of Anti-Matter that can be collected.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;New Alliance Battle &ndash; Personal Rankings</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">If you ever wondered where you stack up against other Agents on Alliance Battle, you can now! Personal Rankings is now added to the Alliance Battle mode.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Check your rank among the Agents, and step up your game!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/281048/image15.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;Chain Amplification for Uru Added + New Changes in Item Storage</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Chain Amplification for Uru Added</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">The Chain Amplification function for Uru, similar to Max Upgrade for gears, is now available with a single touch.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">No longer will you have to keep tapping to amplify Uru to the max.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0075c8; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0075c8; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/281048/image16.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">-</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;When using Chain Amplification for Uru, it will amplify until all Uru slots are amplified!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp; (If you attempt at Chain Amplification consecutively, it will attempt 10 times max at a time even if it does not amplify all Uru slots)</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">Changes in Item Storage</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">One of the big inconveniences of storing tickets in the past, including&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">★</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">2~</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">★</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">6 Rank Up tickets, Mastery Tickets, Mega Rank Up Tickets, Mega Mastery Tickets, Uniform Upgrade Tickets, and Mega Uniform Upgrade Tickets, was that each ticket took up a slot in the inventory, even if you owned multiples of them.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">After this update, the tickets of the same type will stack up in a SINGLE slot, as seen below!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/281048/image17.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;Other Changes</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">1. VIP Bonus Improvement</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #2e74b5;\">Improved Rewards for Co-op Play</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 23.25pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">You can now collect two additional rewards when collecting Co-op Play Completion Rewards, once at VIP Level 17 and once at VIP Level 20.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #2e74b5;\">Character EXP Earned when Using Clear Tickets</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 23.25pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">You can now earn character EXP when using Clear Tickets on Story Missions, Dimension Rift, and other EXP-earning stages at VIP Level 1. (Previously, this was available at VIP Level 17 and higher.)</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 23.25pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">However, the number of times you can receive EXP when using Clear Tickets depends on your VIP level.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #2e74b5;\">Uniform EXP Earned when Using Clear Tickets</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 23.25pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">You can now earn uniform EXP when using Clear Tickets on Story Missions, Dimension Rift, and other EXP-earning stages at VIP Level 17 and higher.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"margin-left: 23.25pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">-<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">However, the number of times you can receive EXP when using Clear Tickets depends on your VIP level.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">2. New icons have been added to Character Portraits so that you can easily identify Level of Potential Unlocked.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Tier Icon</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">New icons at the top left part of the portrait are added to display the level of Potential unlocked, as well as Tier-3. This will help you easily distinguish the characters that are currently unlocking Potential from other Tier-2&nbsp;<a target=\"_parent\">characters</a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/291026/10.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Potential Meter</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">At the character &#115;election screen on the World Boss stage, the Potential meter for eligible characters will be displayed. This will enable you to easily find the characters that need more experience battling World Bosses to earn enough Potential to unlock it.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/281048/image18.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">-</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;Characters that can improve in Potential level by battling World Bosses will have a Potential meter flashed on the&nbsp;top right corner of the portrait.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">3. <span style=\"text-decoration: line-through;\">You can now change Today&rsquo;s World Boss at a cost.&nbsp;</span> -&gt;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 16px;\">This change has been canceled.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-indent: 1.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: .09;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">4. On the Use EXP Chips screen, the chip is now displayed in the order from the most powerful chip to the least.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-indent: 1.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: .09;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">5. A pop-up window will now appear before the Hero &#83;election screen if you do not have any Alliance Battle entry records.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">6. A new &#98;utton to preview recommended character bonus rewards has been added to the character &#115;election screen in Villain Siege.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">7. The following Uniforms are available for purchase with Gold.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/05/281048/image19.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">8. Tony Stark&rsquo;s Supply Chest will be put on sale permanently.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: Verdana; mso-hansi-font-family: Verdana; color: #2e74b5; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-themeshade: 191;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #2e74b5; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-themeshade: 191;\"> Can be purchased once per account</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: Verdana; mso-hansi-font-family: Verdana; color: #2e74b5; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-themeshade: 191;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #2e74b5; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-themeshade: 191;\"> If the package has been purchased in the past, it will no longer be available for purchase.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;Other Fixes</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">The following issues have been fixed:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">1. The issue of Healing effect of Apocalypse's Fear Fragment (5th) skill not activating has been fixed</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">2. The issue of uniform effects not being triggered in Legendary Battle has been fixed. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">3. (Visual Glitch) Issue of displaying 6</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Segoe UI Symbol';\">★ when purchasing</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\"> Adam Warlock has been fixed.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">4. Captain America&rsquo;s Ultimate Skill issues have been fixed.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #2e74b5; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-themeshade: 191;\">&nbsp;- Modeling issues when using the Ultimate Skill</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #2e74b5; mso-themecolor: accent1; mso-themeshade: 191;\">&nbsp;- The issue of enemy Captain America using the Ultimate Skill (Tier-3) even if not at Tier-3 in Shadowland and Alliance Conquest</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">5. An issue of Tier-3 Captain America wearing Secret Wars: 2099 uniform being shown as male as opposed to female has been fixed.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">6. An issue of Mockingbird wearing All-New, All-Different Uniform disappearing from the screen while using skills at Preview Skill has been fixed. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">7. An issue where level 61-70 characters were not affected by type-specific damage has been fixed.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕;\">8. An issue of the 27th-floor stage of Shadowland abruptly ending in defeat under some circumstances has been fixed.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Thank you!</span></p>"
}